## Territory

A named sales region or segment: `name`, `region` and `owner` (linksTo the CRM User). Deals and forecasts are scoped to a Territory rather than to an individual rep, so quota reporting survives a rep being reassigned.

```ts
import { Territory } from '@cardstack/catalog/cards/commerce/territory';

@field territory = linksTo(Territory);
```

### Non-goals
Does not carve boundaries itself: `region` is free text because geography, industry vertical and account tier are each a consumer's call. Does not compute quota attainment.

### Example
`Territory/west-coast-enterprise`, owned by `User/priya-shah`.
